Package: daimondstats
Title: Analytics for Paper Baseball Scorecards
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Woohyun", "Kim", email = "woodenkim92@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analyzes baseball and softball games kept on paper scorecards
    and digitized with the dAImond Inning app. Imports scorecard exports or
    downloads them through the app's API, calculates standard and amateur
    batting statistics (including on-base percentage with errors), checks
    youth pitch counts against Pitch Smart guidelines, evaluates verified
    plays with run expectancy (RE24), compares a personal collection of games
    with a full team season, and writes a one-page season report. Input
    checks reject unreviewed scorecard readings instead of guessing.
